The Battle Subway!{VAR BE01}
As the name suggests, it's the subway
where Trainers wage battles.

The Battle Subway has seven lines
in total!{VAR BE01}
But I heard that the only lines you can
take at the beginning are the Single,{VAR BE00}
Double, or Multi Trains!

Hi, hi!{VAR BE01}
Please tell me how you introduce yourself
before a battle and how you feel when{VAR BE00}
you win or lose.
